OL,3,GNEWSACollege bids to fill EV skills gap
OL,4,Awith #19m centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #19.3m training centre has opened to
OL,7,Fteach budding mechanics how to work on
OL,8,Fhybrid and electric vehicles.
OL,10,FThe extension to Bradford College,
OL,11,FJunction Mills, was built on the site
OL,12,Fof a derelict textile mill on Thornton
OL,13,FRoad and has facilities for up to 650
OL,14,Fstudents.
OL,16,FThe four-storey site is one of the
OL,17,Fbiggest developments in Bradford city
OL,18,Fcentre since One City Park, the college
OL,19,Fsaid, and took two years to complete.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
