OL,3,GNEWSACollege bids to fill EV skills gap
OL,4,Awith #19m centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Smith, Head of Department for
OL,7,FMotor Vehicle and Engineering, said the
OL,8,Fnew facilities would allow the college
OL,9,Fto fill skills gaps in the industry.
